{npc, key=man_on_deck, name=Man on Deck, parent=cruise_top_pool
    {enter_message
        output={@


You see a shadowy man.
He is wearing a cloak with a deep hood. It is subtly flickering binary code
at random moments.

He approaches you.
"I know you. I have a chip for you."
He gives you a microchip.
"If you can read it, you can join."

Then he strolls up to the edge of the deck's railing.

"Shellspace should be open source."

With that he jumps overboard. No one else seems to notice.
You rush to the railing, but he is gone.

        }

        {set, logic=[invite_chip]parent, output=[player] }
        {set, logic=[invite_chip]tags, output=+inventory }
        {set, logic=[self]parent, output=limbo }
    }
}
